*.root
*-workspace
*.log
*.DS_Store
*_C*
*.pdf
*.png

# The configuration of each Hyperloop train, saved by Macros/downloadHYOutput.py in a tree that mirrors DataFile/
# (one JSON per data file, with its name). Out of git as the data files are.
TrainConfigs/

# Graphify's output: 16 MB of generated graph, rebuilt on demand from the sources.
# The .graphifyignore that shapes it IS tracked - that one is configuration.
graphify-out/

# Build artifacts
build/

# RooFit research: scratch programs and outputs, copied out of /private/tmp so they survive a reboot.
# Large and regenerable; the notes in RooFitKnowledge/ are what is tracked.
RooFitKnowledge/scratch/

# OldComparison: the old inputs and everything run.sh makes stay out of git (OldComparison/README.md).
OldComparison/data/
OldComparison/output/
# ...except a snapshot of a result, kept for reference (OldComparison/README.md).
!OldComparison/reference/*
# The extrapolation study: the same, its output out and its reference in. Every file of the two reference folders,
# not only the figures: *_C* above matches checks_configHigh_* too, since git compares names without case here.
OldComparison/extrapolation/output/
!OldComparison/extrapolation/reference/*
# The fit-model selection: every run's output stays out (FitModelSelection/README.md).
FitModelSelection/output/
# The comparison with the old analysis as written up against its analysis note (an internal ALICE document, with
# figures extracted from it), and the investigation behind it: kept here, not published with this repository.
OldComparison/OLD_VS_NEW_ANALYSIS.md
OldComparison/investigation/
# The plots made on request (PDFs of the summaries, the three-method ratios, the comparisons), one folder per day: they
# show unpublished results and are regenerable from their specifications, so they stay out of this public repository.
Figures/
